WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.614
Module four, aakhiri module. Live chat aur customer care.

2
00:00:04.614 --> 00:00:10.101
Jab customers reply karein toh kya karna hai, aur number ko safe kaise rakhna hai.

3
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:17.566
Ye customer care ka dil hai. Har reply, sawaal aur complaint live chat mein aati

4
00:00:17.566 --> 00:00:23.029
Hai. Aap kitni jaldi aur kitni achhi tarah jawaab dete hain, usi se tay hota hai ki

5
00:00:23.029 --> 00:00:26.188
Customers Oribrix ke baare mein kya sochte hain.

6
00:00:26.638 --> 00:00:28.622
Pehle, live chat inbox.

7
00:00:29.072 --> 00:00:31.504
Phir tags, history aur contacts.

8
00:00:31.954 --> 00:00:34.130
Phir agents aur unke roles.

9
00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:38.100
Phir opt-out management, jo number ko safe rakhta hai.

10
00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:40.790
Phir welcome aur away messages.

11
00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:44.611
Aur aakhir mein, chatbot flows aur integrations.

12
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.819
Jab koi customer Oribrix ko likhta hai toh ye hota hai.

13
00:00:51.269 --> 00:00:54.853
Message, left menu wale Live chat mein aata hai.

14
00:00:55.303 --> 00:00:58.012
Agents ko notification milta hai.

15
00:00:58.462 --> 00:01:03.987
Ek agent conversation uthata hai. Manager bhi kabhi bhi bich mein aa sakta hai.

16
00:01:04.437 --> 00:01:10.023
Agent reply karta hai. Twenty four hour window ke andar aap freely likh sakte hain,

17
00:01:10.023 --> 00:01:11.840
Template ki zaroorat nahin.

18
00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:17.474
Agent chat ko tag karta hai, jaise hot lead, complaint ya order issue.

19
00:01:17.924 --> 00:01:23.210
Twenty four hours ke baad chat History mein chali jaati hai, jahan aap use phir bhi

20
00:01:23.210 --> 00:01:26.585
Dhoondh sakte hain aur tags se filter kar sakte hain.

21
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.412
WhatsApp pe customer care ka ye sabse zaroori rule hai.

22
00:01:32.412 --> 00:01:37.562
Customer ke aakhiri message ke baad aapke paas twenty four hours hain kisi bhi text

23
00:01:37.562 --> 00:01:42.464
Se reply karne ke liye. Window band hone ke baad aap conversation sirf approved

24
00:01:42.464 --> 00:01:47.676
Template se hi phir shuru kar sakte hain. Isliye customers ko usi din jawaab dijiye.

25
00:01:47.676 --> 00:01:52.019
Late reply zyada mahanga padta hai aur customer ko bhi bura lagta hai.

26
00:02:37.833 --> 00:02:40.990
Achhe records se follow-up aasaan hota hai.

27
00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:46.817
Tags aapke apne labels hain. Ek chhota, fixed set banaiye, jaise hot lead,

28
00:02:46.817 --> 00:02:51.467
Complaint, refund, vendor enquiry, aur har baar inhe use kijiye.

29
00:02:51.917 --> 00:02:55.864
History mein twenty four hours se purani chats rehti hain.

30
00:02:56.314 --> 00:03:01.976
Contacts mein wo sab hain jinhonne Oribrix ko message kiya ya jinhe campaign mein

31
00:03:01.976 --> 00:03:02.884
Message gaya.

32
00:03:03.334 --> 00:03:08.518
Aap contact lists import kar sakte hain, aur database export kar sakte hain.

33
00:03:08.968 --> 00:03:14.750
Contacts ko tags aur attributes se filter kijiye, aur us group ko broadcast kijiye.

34
00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:18.378
Aur blocked aur opted-in numbers manage kijiye.

35
00:03:20.766 --> 00:03:25.502
Aap fifteen tak team members add kar sakte hain, har ek ke role ke saatha.

36
00:03:25.952 --> 00:03:31.652
Owner sab kuch dekhta aur control karta hai, billing, settings aur API key sameta.

37
00:03:31.652 --> 00:03:34.293
Ise ek ya do senior logon tak rakhiye.

38
00:03:34.743 --> 00:03:38.861
Manager team chalata hai: campaigns, reports aur live chat.

39
00:03:39.311 --> 00:03:43.817
Agent ke paas sirf live chat aur campaigns ka access hota hai.

40
00:03:43.817 --> 00:03:47.379
Zyadatar customer care staff agents hone chahiye.

41
00:03:47.379 --> 00:03:51.449
Har insan ko uska apna login dijiye, kabhi shared nahin.

42
00:03:53.833 --> 00:03:59.315
Agar customers Oribrix ka number block ya report karte hain, toh Meta uski limits

43
00:03:59.315 --> 00:04:04.865
Ghata sakta hai ya use restrict kar sakta hai. Opt-out management se aap ise rokte

44
00:04:04.865 --> 00:04:05.204
Hain.

45
00:04:05.654 --> 00:04:11.648
Jab customer stop, unsubscribe ya not interested jaise words se reply karta hai,

46
00:04:12.098 --> 00:04:16.450
Toh platform unhe automatically opted out mark kar deta hai.

47
00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:20.314
Agle campaign se unhe messages nahi jaayenge.

48
00:04:20.764 --> 00:04:26.630
Kam blocks aur reports se number healthy rehta hai aur daily limit badhti rehti hai.

49
00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:31.426
Aur opted-out logon ko kabhi haath se vaapas add mat kijiye.

50
00:04:31.426 --> 00:04:35.336
Kisi ki na ka samman karna hi achhi customer care hai.

51
00:04:37.733 --> 00:04:43.368
Manage aur settings menu mein inhe ek baar set kijiye, aur ye roz aapke liye kaam

52
00:04:43.368 --> 00:04:44.133
Karte hain.

53
00:04:44.583 --> 00:04:49.276
Welcome message, jo koi pehli baar likhe toh automatically jaata hai.

54
00:04:49.726 --> 00:04:55.230
Off hours ke liye away message, taaki customers ko pata ho ki reply kab aayega.

55
00:04:55.680 --> 00:05:00.651
Working hours, taaki platform ko pata ho ki team kab on hai aur kab off.

56
00:05:01.101 --> 00:05:06.235
Campaign safety. Agar bich mein template ki category badal jaaye, toh campaign ruk

57
00:05:06.235 --> 00:05:06.861
Jaata hai.

58
00:05:07.311 --> 00:05:10.084
Day aur month ke hisaab se analytics.

59
00:05:10.534 --> 00:05:16.017
Aur billing and usage, saath mein phone ya laptop ke liye notification settings.

60
00:05:18.433 --> 00:05:23.309
Chatbot common savalon ke jawaab automatically deta hai, din aur raata.

61
00:05:23.309 --> 00:05:26.881
Aap drag and drop se five tak flows bana sakte hain.

62
00:05:27.331 --> 00:05:28.867
Flow builder kholiye.

63
00:05:29.317 --> 00:05:34.288
Ek start message drag kijiye, jaise welcome to Oribrix, how can we help?

64
00:05:34.738 --> 00:05:40.327
Buttons ya list jodiye: track my order, prices, become a vendor, talk to support.

65
00:05:40.777 --> 00:05:47.177
Actions jodiye, jaise media bhejna, location maangna, ya product catalogue dikhana.

66
00:05:47.627 --> 00:05:52.384
Kisi branch ko human agent se, ya doosre flow se connect kijiye.

67
00:05:52.834 --> 00:05:56.796
Active pe click kijiye, aur save kijiye. Flow ab live hai.

68
00:05:56.796 --> 00:06:02.259
Hamesha talk to support option rakhiye, taaki customers bot ke saath kabhi atken

69
00:06:02.259 --> 00:06:02.669
Nahin.

70
00:06:05.066 --> 00:06:10.470
Aakhir mein, wo standards jo har Oribrix customer care agent ko follow karne

71
00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:11.039
Chahiye.

72
00:06:11.489 --> 00:06:15.628
Usi din reply kijiye, twenty four hour window ke andra.

73
00:06:16.078 --> 00:06:20.963
Customers ko naam se greet kijiye, aur messages chhote aur clear rakhiye.

74
00:06:21.413 --> 00:06:27.195
Har chat ko tag kijiye, taaki koi bhi wahin se aage badha sake jahan aapne chhoda.

75
00:06:27.645 --> 00:06:33.810
O T Ps, passwords ya API key kabhi share mat kijiye, na chat mein na kahin aura.

76
00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:36.287
Opt-outs ka samman kijiye.

77
00:06:36.737 --> 00:06:41.921
Aur refunds aur complaints ko usi din sahi insan tak escalate kijiye.

78
00:06:44.333 --> 00:06:50.034
Aakhiri quick check. Ek customer ne thirty hours pehle likha, aur kisi ne reply nahi

79
00:06:50.034 --> 00:06:53.223
Kiya. Ab aap unhe message kaise kar sakte hain?

80
00:06:53.223 --> 00:06:54.445
Ek second sochiye.

81
00:06:58.395 --> 00:07:03.707
Answer: sirf approved template se, kyunki twenty four hour window band ho chuki hai.

82
00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:08.591
Poore course ko recap karte hain.

83
00:07:09.041 --> 00:07:13.883
Module one. Fresh number, business documents, daily limits aur dashboard.

84
00:07:14.333 --> 00:07:18.493
Module two. Teen categories mein templates, Meta se approved.

85
00:07:18.943 --> 00:07:24.469
Module three. CSV broadcasts, analytics, aur secret key ke saath API.

86
00:07:24.919 --> 00:07:30.017
Module four. Twenty four hour window, tags, roles, opt-outs aur chatbot.

87
00:07:30.017 --> 00:07:35.116
Ab practice quiz try kijiye, phir certificate ke liye final quiz dijiye.

88
00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:42.505
Module 4 yahin khatam hota hai. Aapne charon modules poore kar liye hain.

89
00:07:42.505 --> 00:07:45.521
Ab quiz dijiye, aur apna certificate lijiye.
